   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "RefMod install smoke test \u2014 needs only the H3 video VAE, no 29B model.\n\n1. Put 3-8 images of one subject in  ComfyUI/input/refmod_test/\n   (or point the Folder widget at any absolute path).\n2. Point VAELoader at your H3 video VAE:\n   models/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors\n3. Queue the prompt. Create H3 RefMod encodes the folder and writes\n   models/refmods/smoke_test_identity.safetensors (~1-2 MB).\n4. Inspect H3 RefMod decodes the stored latent back to pixels: if the\n   preview looks like your subject, the VAE and the pack both work.\n\nA saved file under ~100 KB means the encode failed (see the console).\nTo re-load the file afterwards, add a Load H3 RefMods node, press R to\nrefresh its dropdown, and pick smoke_test_identity."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
